<div id="A3.SS1.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A3.SS1.p1.1" class="ltx_p">We show more examples of SpaRE models compared to similar VLMs in Figure <a href="#A3.F4" title="Figure 4 ‣ C.1 Response Generation ‣ Appendix C Qualitative Analysis ‣ SpaRE: Enhancing Spatial Reasoning in Vision-Language Models with Synthetic Data" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">4</span></a>.</p>
